"lessons":"She follows through best in evenings (about 91%), especially the 17:30-19:00 habitual window, and on days with large free windows. Mornings, social and psychological-capability contexts are weaker, and intensity 3 is least reliable. Cardio sessions are therefore spread over separate days in habitual evening slots. Long tasks only fit in the big Saturday and Sunday morning windows. Short planning and alongside tasks go in evenings."}
